# Feedback log (append-only). One JSON reaction per line. Schema:
#   {"ts":"YYYY-MM-DD","kind":"loved|went|skipped|hide|clicked_ticket|added_calendar",
#    "artists":[...],"genres":[...],"note":"..."}
# Folded into the affinity layer automatically each run (scripts/lib/feedback.py) — no
# hand-merge into taste.yaml. Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
# Append real reactions as you react to digests, e.g.:
#   {"ts":"2026-06-20","kind":"loved","artists":["Antal"]}
#   {"ts":"2026-06-20","kind":"hide","artists":["Some Bro DJ"]}
